    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_SessionWaitingForInput">Protection is active. Use a controller to start watching it</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_SessionTracking">Watching the controllers used in this game</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_NoActiveSessionControllers">No controller set for suspension. Use a controller during gameplay to start tracking.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_AllowControllerTakeover">Allow another controller to take over after a confirmed disconnection</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_AllowControllerTakeoverHelp">When enabled, fresh input from another controller can replace a disconnected one. In local multiplayer, an already active player's controller never replaces another player.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_GameOverridesHelp">Use a game's context menu to choose automatic single-player ownership or explicit local multiplayer protection.</sys:String>
